    "independent": false,
    "summary": "Browser criterion B00 failed because the requested business feature was never implemented: the application shipped as the untouched default template (placeholder home, no material collection, one built-in admin account, only Atlas in AI Employees). Implemented the read-only 资料助手 end to end: materials + assistantMessages migrations; server-enforced record visibility through the Authorization composite model; a grounded, citation-carrying assistant service that works with or without an AI model service; Hono routes; 资料库 and 资料助手 pages with navigation, a business landing page and bilingual copy; and seeded three fictional materials, two permission sets and two isolated test accounts, all idempotently. Verified against a real SQLite database, including the confidentiality boundary (a colleague cannot read the supervisor-only material on the page or through the assistant), transcript persistence across refresh, and the supervisor-edit/colleague-re-ask flow. Two runtime defects found by the smoke test were fixed before finishing. A later repair round fixed three failing app-server tests caused by the materials provider and the seed-data import.",
